    text: "Resumed verification: npm ci, current-base rebase, fresh committed-dist comparison, strict local tracker health with required merge drivers, npm run release:check, and bun install --no-save all passed. Full gate: 174 tests, 174 pass, 0 skips; configured coverage thresholds unchanged. PM-linked test/release-workflow.test.ts passed. Earlier findings and technical refusals retained; no new source fix was needed in this restart. Exact pushed-head CI and substantive reviewer availability remain separate checks; no merge, release, publication or item closure."
  - created_at: "2026-10-02T23:28:07.013Z"
    author: codex-sol-land
    text: "New Cubic finding 4170603509 is refused: Refused for this exact head: the completed Node 26 job used Node v26.10.0 and npm 11.19.1, not npm 12. Its real project-local pm package install of pm-github@2026.9.26, installed-version assertion, strict health and full CI gate all passed at acf6918. The statement that CI had not run is also contradicted by that completed job. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/actions/runs/37076601628/job/111067793577 . This is current-runner certification; no npm-12 certification is claimed and the obsolete npm-10 shim is not required for this verified job."
